{
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-bForestStart-3561": "WEISS: 话说有这么个下士，他那支部队在蔡施塔特的差事，就是把伊纳人统统赶出家门，再押上火车。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-bForestStart-3562": "WEISS: 每回人一赶走，军官们就来挑好东西。珠宝啦，银器啦，什么值钱拿什么。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-bForestStart-3563": "MUELLER: 可不是嘛，好处都让军官占了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-bForestStart-3564": "KONITZ: 驱逐伊纳人，不是有专门的志愿部队负责吗？可别把我也派去干这个。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-bForestStart-3565": "WEISS: 总之，那下士就想：“我干活可比这些军官卖力多了，也该让我拿点好东西吧。”",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-bForestStart-3566": "WEISS: 有一天，他顺了件小东西，是块金表。可表拿到手，他愣是找不着在哪儿上发条。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-bForestStart-3567": "WEISS: 因为它压根儿就没有上发条的旋钮！那表是靠肮脏的伊纳魔法走的！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-bForestStart-3568": "WEISS: 后来他去了趟军械库，你们猜那表里的魔法干了什么？把几颗手榴弹的引信点着了！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-bForestStart-3569": "WEISS: 然后——轰！整座库房都烧起来了！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-bForestStart-3570": "KONITZ: 可他们怎么知道是那块表闯的祸？弹药一炸，下士跟金表不都该烧没了吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-bForestStart-3571": "WEISS: 没啊，他赶在爆炸前跳进了个开着门的枪柜。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-bForestStart-3572": "NIKOLAI: 这就能看出，故事是编的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-bForestStart-3573": "WEISS: 哎，班长，这么好的故事，您就别拆台了嘛！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-bForestStart-3574": "NIKOLAI: 通常要命的不是烧伤，而是大火把空气耗光，让人窒息而死；躲在枪柜里也没用。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-bForestStart-3575": "KONITZ: 上士，您怎么知道这些的？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-bForestStart-3576": "NIKOLAI: 我以前带过一支扑救弹药火灾的队伍。困在库房里的人，通常都活不下来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-bForestStart-3577": "NIKOLAI: 沿着这条路继续走，直到山脊。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-bForestStart-3578": "NIKOLAI: 跟紧，留神树丛里的埋伏！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-bfBridge-3579": "WEISS: 这是搜索任务，对吧？什么时候才告诉我们在找谁？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-bfBridge-3580": "MUELLER: 是啊，指挥部干吗把目标藏着掖着？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-bfBridge-3581": "NIKOLAI: 我们要找一个野蛮人的营地，他叫阿平戈里克斯。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-bfBridge-3582": "MUELLER: 等等，那个劫掠者阿平戈里克斯！？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-bfBridge-3583": "WEISS: 就咱们这么个小队，去找这么大的目标？看来上头又想让咱们去送死了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-bfBridge-3584": "NIKOLAI: 你说什么，下士？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-bfBridge-3585": "WEISS: 你和基尔歇尔刚来，也许还不知道，军队看谁不顺眼，就把谁塞进边防部队。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-bfBridge-3586": "MUELLER: 要是特别看不顺眼，就塞进第七师。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-bfBridge-3587": "WEISS: 真想要你的命，就把你派到阿尔特迈尔上尉手下，他再把你送进树林，枪一响，一英里外的敌人都知道你在哪儿了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-bfBridge-3588": "NIKOLAI: 下士，有几件事我得跟你说清楚。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-bfBridge-3589": "NIKOLAI: 第一，在光荣的第七边防师服役，不是惩罚，是机会。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-bfBridge-3590": "NIKOLAI: 第二，长官看你不顺眼，也许是因为你太爱发牢骚。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-bfBridge-3591": "NIKOLAI: 第三，阿尔特迈尔上尉特意给我们的步枪施了消声术，枪声传不出去。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-bfBridge-3592": "WEISS: 上士，那法术我见得多了，也就能撑……一个小时？到这里之前就该失效了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-bfBridge-3593": "KONITZ: 没有，魔法还在起作用，因为我们带了个特殊的……嗯，待会儿就知道了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-bfBridge-3594": "NIKOLAI: 军队总是在进步，小伙子们，你们也得学着往前看，想想怎么把事情做得更好。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-bfBridge-3595": "NIKOLAI: 前进！还有任务要办。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-stumpScene-3596": "KONITZ: 我想，这里应该够高了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-stumpScene-3597": "NIKOLAI: 好，但别把脑袋探到别人看得见的地方，我们只是消了声，可没隐身。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-stumpScene-3598": "KONITZ: 明白。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-stumpScene-3599": "WEISS: 等等，他在干什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-stumpScene-3600": "KONITZ: 我能告诉他吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-stumpScene-3601": "NIKOLAI: 技术兵科尼茨要用一点魔法。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-stumpScene-3602": "MUELLER: 等等，他又不是军官。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-stumpScene-3603": "WEISS: 是啊，军官为了学魔法，可得念十年书。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-stumpScene-3604": "KONITZ: 谁都得念十年书……军官能用魔法，是因为升格仪式。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-stumpScene-3605": "NIKOLAI: 科尼茨本人当然没有魔法能力，要用的法术都是阿尔特迈尔上尉事先施好的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-stumpScene-3606": "KONITZ: 然后，全都存进了这个装置！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-stumpScene-3607": "MUELLER: 这……是什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-stumpScene-3608": "KONITZ: 魔法终端！能把魔法保存好几天，甚至好几个星期。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-stumpScene-3609": "WEISS: 不是军官也能用魔法？这我喜欢。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-stumpScene-3610": "MUELLER: 怎么用？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-stumpScene-3611": "NIKOLAI: 交给科尼茨解释吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-stumpScene-3612": "KONITZ: 基本上就是拨几个开关，不过站得高些，远离魔力地脉，探寻术会更好用。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-stumpScene-3613": "NIKOLAI: 小心点，科尼茨，把头低下。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-stumpScene-3614": "KONITZ: 几秒钟就好。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-stumpScene-3615": "NIKOLAI: 科尼茨……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-stumpScene-3616": "KONITZ: 好！一点干扰都没有……然后……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-stumpScene-3617": "NIKOLAI: 科尼茨！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-stumpScene-3618": "NIKOLAI: 集合！跟上！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-stumpDescend-3619": "NIKOLAI: 科尼茨！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-stumpDescend-3620": "KONITZ: 唔……我没事，上士，就是脚踝伤得挺重。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-stumpDescend-3621": "NIKOLAI: 我拿你的急救包……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-stumpDescend-3622": "KONITZ: 帮我把终端拿来就行，里面应该存了几道治疗法术。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-stumpDescend-3623": "KONITZ: 终端往洞里滚下去了一小段。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-getTerminal-3624": "NIKOLAI: 看着没摔坏。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-getTerminal-3625": "NIKOLAI: 有风从什么地方吹进来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-hurtKonitz-3626": "KONITZ: 就往洞里滚了一小段。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-hurtKonitz-3627": "NIKOLAI: 终端拿到了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-hurtKonitz-3628": "KONITZ: 好，把控制旋钮转到第三档……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-hurtKonitz-3629": "NIKOLAI: 转什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-hurtKonitz-3630": "KONITZ: 算了，还是让我来——",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-hurtKonitz-3631": "NIKOLAI: 起效了吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-hurtKonitz-3632": "KONITZ: 嗯，感觉……好极了，这法术比我想的强得多。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-hurtKonitz-3633": "WEISS: 现在怎么办，班长？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-hurtKonitz-3634": "NIKOLAI: 这里可能就是阿平戈里克斯的藏身处。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-hurtKonitz-3635": "KONITZ: 我们不该跟目标接触吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-hurtKonitz-3636": "NIKOLAI: 我看这里没人，但必须弄清他有没有来过。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-hurtKonitz-3637": "NIKOLAI: 叫米勒和基尔歇尔下来，还有任务要办。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-caveWeiss-3638": "WEISS: 科尼茨没事吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-bCaveKonitzLeft-3639": "NIKOLAI: （先帮科尼茨。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-bCaveKonitzRight-3640": "NIKOLAI: （先帮科尼茨。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-ladderWeiss-3641": "WEISS: 那孩子没事吧？其他人都在上面等着。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-barbariansEnterCave-3642": "NIKOLAI: 看来他们刚离开不久。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-barbariansEnterCave-3643": "NIKOLAI: 也可能是受了惊，匆匆忙忙逃走了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-barbariansEnterCave-3644": "KIRCHER: 也可能出去劫掠了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-barbariansEnterCave-3645": "NIKOLAI: 不管怎样，任务完成了，咱们收——",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-barbariansEnterCave-3651": "NIKOLAI: 该走了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-forestConfrontation-3652": "VOICE: 出来，奥斯伦人。你们人少，打不过我们的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-forestConfrontation-3653": "WEISS: 这位置可不妙，班长。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-forestConfrontation-3654": "NIKOLAI: 谢谢提醒，下士，我知道。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-forestConfrontation-3655": "NIKOLAI: 科尼茨，能不能让终端……直接往外释放魔力？越多越好。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-forestConfrontation-3656": "KONITZ: 呃……应该能？为什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-forestConfrontation-3657": "NIKOLAI: 别管原因，朝着洞口就行。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-forestConfrontation-3658": "NIKOLAI: 如果他们抓走我，你们就守在掩体里，等增援。瞄准了再开枪，省着点子弹。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-forestConfrontation-3659": "NIKOLAI: 你就是阿平戈里克斯？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-forestConfrontation-3660": "APINGORIX: 你很清楚我是谁。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-forestConfrontation-3661": "APINGORIX: 我长话短说，你听过的那些传闻，不管把我说得多可怕，都还差得远呢。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-forestConfrontation-3662": "APINGORIX: 扔下武器，我也许还能留你们派点用场。只要还有用，你们就有活命的机会。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-forestConfrontation-3663": "NIKOLAI: 你说的有用，是拿来当人质？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-forestConfrontation-3664": "APINGORIX: 别装傻，奥斯伦人，你们没得选，你我都清楚。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-forestConfrontation-3665": "NIKOLAI: 是吗？我们有枪，也有掩体，这仗也许赢不了，可你也得折些人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-forestConfrontation-3666": "APINGORIX: 我大可以叫法师，把那山洞变成烤炉。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-forestConfrontation-3667": "????: 不得不说，那场面可真够讽刺的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-forestConfrontation-3668": "APINGORIX: 给你二十秒考虑。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-forestConfrontation-3669": "NIKOLAI: 应该够了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-forestConfrontation-3670": "APINGORIX: 什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-forestConfrontation-3671": "NIKOLAI: 刚才远处那声响，听见了吗？阿尔特迈尔上尉正用迫击炮轰击我们的位置。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-forestConfrontation-3672": "APINGORIX: 对自己人开炮？就算你们的军官，也没狂妄到这地步。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-forestConfrontation-3673": "NIKOLAI: 炮弹还在天上飞的时候，他们就能用魔法修正落点。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-forestConfrontation-3674": "NIKOLAI: 你真没跟军官交过手？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-forestConfrontation-3675": "APINGORIX: 我跟你没什么可——",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-forestConfrontation-3676": "WEISS: 怎么回事？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-forestConfrontation-3677": "NIKOLAI: 上尉看见我们的信号，出手支援了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-forestConfrontation-3678": "NIKOLAI: 不会有更好的机会了，集合！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-ladderGone-3679": "NIKOLAI: 看来他们把梯子收上去了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-borderScene-3680": "NIKOLAI: 嗯。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-borderScene-3681": "WEISS: 雪一化，这河流得可真急，你说他们过去了吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-borderScene-3682": "NIKOLAI: 肯定过了，问题是咱们能不能过去。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-borderScene-3683": "????: 你们过不来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-borderScene-3684": "LUSKIYAN OFFICER: 河这边，是卢斯基亚的主权领土。你们不准进入。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-borderScene-3685": "LUSKIYAN OFFICER: 除非，你打算就凭这几个兵，发动一场战争。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-borderScene-3686": "LUSKIYAN OFFICER: 我可不觉得，你们会有什么好下场。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-borderScene-3687": "KONITZ: 上士，地图就在这里。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-borderScene-3688": "KONITZ: 我们离卢斯基亚边境还远着呢。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-borderScene-3689": "NIKOLAI: 他的地图恐怕不是这么画的，不过不值得为这开战。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-borderScene-3690": "NIKOLAI: 你们刚才有没有看见一群说杰兰德语的野蛮人过河？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-borderScene-3691": "LUSKIYAN OFFICER: 卢斯基亚没有野蛮人。我们不像你们奥斯伦人那样歧视别人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-borderScene-3692": "LUSKIYAN OFFICER: 在我国，每个人都是对社会有用的一员。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-borderScene-3693": "LUSKIYAN OFFICER: 好了，小伙子们，回你们长官身边去吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-borderScene-3694": "KIRCHER: 上士，我听见他们有个士兵嘀咕了句“我们的客人”。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-borderScene-3695": "NIKOLAI: 就算听不懂卢斯基亚语，也知道他在骗我们。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-borderScene-3696": "VOICE: 不过，这已经不是你的事了，普罗赫上士。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-borderScene-3697": "NIKOLAI: 长官！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-borderScene-3698": "NIKOLAI: 报告长官，我们跟目标发生了一点……意外接触。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-borderScene-3699": "ALTMAYER: 确实如此，上士，我看见你的信号了，可惜没多少时间准备迫击炮。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-borderScene-3700": "NIKOLAI: 我们认为，阿平戈里克斯和手下已经渡河，可能有卢斯基亚军队接应。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-borderScene-3701": "ALTMAYER: 不必担心，指挥部早就想拔掉这根钉子，他走了，他们应该会很高兴。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-borderScene-3702": "ALTMAYER: 我们把几辆卡车开进了东边的山口，离这里不远，会送你们去驻地。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-borderScene-3703": "ALTMAYER: 动作快点，你们在那里待不了多久。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-borderScene-3704": "NIKOLAI: 是，长官。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-borderScene-3705": "NIKOLAI: 都听见了，走。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-borderScene-3706": "NIKOLAI: 好，人都上车了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-borderScene-3707": "NIKOLAI: 今天干得不错，各位，大家都很冷静，继续保持。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-borderScene-3708": "NIKOLAI: 科尼茨，你一定得多留意周围的情况，不能再这样了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-borderScene-3709": "MUELLER: 差点把我们全害死……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-borderScene-3710": "NIKOLAI: 进洞搜索，是我下的决定。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-borderScene-3711": "NIKOLAI: 可我也不想你平白无故地受伤，难道要我去告诉你母亲，你是掉进山洞才出事的？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-borderScene-3712": "KONITZ: 她说不定都顾不上留意，我家有十一个孩子，我排倒数第二。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-borderScene-3713": "WEISS: 十一个！？他们给你母亲发勋章了吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-borderScene-3714": "KONITZ: 没有，我想她更愿意多要一条面包和一打鸡蛋。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-borderScene-3715": "MUELLER: 你还是个孩子吧？当兵多久了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-borderScene-3716": "KONITZ: 两年多一点。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-borderScene-3717": "KONITZ: 十六岁生日的第二天入伍的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-borderScene-3718": "MUELLER: 哦……还真是。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-borderScene-3719": "NIKOLAI: 好了，你们四个住镇子西北头的旅馆。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-borderScene-3720": "KONITZ: 您呢，上士？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-borderScene-3721": "NIKOLAI: 这是我老家，镇上的人我全认识，你们敢惹事，他们肯定会告诉我。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-borderScene-3722": "NIKOLAI: 明天天一亮就会有新命令，都给我按时起床。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-borderScene-3723": "NIKOLAI: 去休息吧，规矩点。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-dreyfussBattle-3724": "DREYFUSS: 很好，我正盼着再有机会收拾你们。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-dreyfussBattle-3725": "DREYFUSS: 好久没宰过乌拉尔特总理的走狗了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-dreyfussBattle-3726": "WEISS: 他奥斯伦语说得挺好啊？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-dreyfussBattle-3727": "DREYFUSS: 倒是你，听着像个扬尼斯马克养猪户的儿子。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-dreyfussBattle-3728": "NIKOLAI: 我不知道你是谁，不过任务里没提到你，你不招惹我们，我们也不招惹你。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-dreyfussBattle-3729": "DREYFUSS: 又是你那宝贝命令……叫你做什么，你就照单全收，是吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-dreyfussBattle-3730": "KONITZ: 等等，你是伊纳人？被驱逐的？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-dreyfussBattle-3731": "DREYFUSS: 驱逐！？你们这些没脑子的农夫，真是上面说什么就信什么。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-dreyfussBattle-3732": "DREYFUSS: 回答我，走狗。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-dreyfussBattle-3733": "DREYFUSS: 要只是驱逐，为什么半夜才来我们家抓人？嗯？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-dreyfussBattle-3734": "DREYFUSS: 果然，问到这里你就没话说了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-dreyfussBattle-3735": "DREYFUSS: 不……不能在这里……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-dreyfussBattle-3736": "DREYFUSS: 不能这样……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/BarbarianForest.yarn-dreyfussBattle-3737": "WEISS: 看来你说得没错，伊纳魔法果然危险。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/ForestBattles.yarn-firstForestBattle-3738": "NIKOLAI: 子弹打这东西没用。科尼茨，你上！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/ForestBattles.yarn-firstForestBattle-3739": "把后排的科尼茨换上来！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/therme.yarn-bakeryScene-3740": "DIETRICH: 抱歉，你的战友已经买走……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/therme.yarn-bakeryScene-3741": "DIETRICH: 尼科！？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/therme.yarn-bakeryScene-3742": "DIETRICH: 老天！怎么不写信告诉我，你要回来？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/therme.yarn-bakeryScene-3743": "DIETRICH: 我就提前烤些甜餐包了！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/therme.yarn-bakeryScene-3744": "NIKOLAI: 嘿，爸。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/therme.yarn-bakeryScene-3745": "NIKOLAI: 我自己也不知道会来，今天才刚从边境回来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/therme.yarn-bakeryScene-3746": "DIETRICH: 饿了吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/therme.yarn-bakeryScene-3747": "DIETRICH: 炖牛肉倒有，就是没发面餐包了，还有……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/therme.yarn-bakeryScene-3748": "DIETRICH: 等等，边境？你不是带消防班的吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/therme.yarn-bakeryScene-3749": "NIKOLAI: 是啊，后来调动了，我写了信，大概是人比信先到了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/therme.yarn-bakeryScene-3750": "DIETRICH: 等等，军衔上是不是多了一道杠？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/therme.yarn-bakeryScene-3751": "NIKOLAI: 对，他们说我现在是上士了，可不知道怎么，手下的人倒少了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/therme.yarn-bakeryScene-3752": "DIETRICH: 比我当年都高了，不过我只是个炊事兵，没什么上进心。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/therme.yarn-bakeryScene-3753": "DIETRICH: 来，我给你盛点炖肉！进来坐，慢慢讲给我听。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/therme.yarn-bakeryScene-3754": "????: 怎么样？终端和搜索小队的情况如何？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/therme.yarn-bakeryScene-3755": "KIRCHER: 他们掌握得还算熟练，没有违规举动。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/therme.yarn-bakeryScene-3756": "KIRCHER: 野蛮人那边出了点意外，不过不会有问题吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/therme.yarn-bakeryScene-3757": "????: 只要他们进了卢斯基亚，就没有问题。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/therme.yarn-bakeryScene-3758": "KIRCHER: 所以马上要发动入侵了？什么时候？明天？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/therme.yarn-bakeryScene-3759": "????: 到时你就知道了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/therme.yarn-bakeryScene-3760": "KIRCHER: 为什么非得让我扮成普通士兵？我可不想一直听一个军士发号施令。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/therme.yarn-bakeryScene-3761": "????: 他们要的是普罗赫处理火灾的经验，不过他操作终端时，必须有个会魔法的人在旁边盯着。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/therme.yarn-bakeryScene-3762": "????: 他也不是唯一被这样安排的人，中尉，你很快就会得到更适合你的任务。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/therme.yarn-bakeryScene-3763": "DIETRICH: 尼科，醒醒。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/therme.yarn-bakeryScene-3764": "DIETRICH: 有件事，你得看看。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/therme.yarn-waitMyMen-3765": "NIKOLAI: （还是先跟旅店老板把住宿的事安排好。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/therme.yarn-waitMyMen-3766": "NIKOLAI: （今晚就回去休息了吗？）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/therme.yarn-waitMyMen-3767": "还没……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/therme.yarn-waitMyMen-3768": "可以了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/therme.yarn-theFireShips-3769": "NIKOLAI: 什么……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/therme.yarn-theFireShips-3770": "NIKOLAI: 那到底是什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/therme.yarn-theFireShips-3771": "DIETRICH: 看天上。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/therme.yarn-theFireShips-3772": "NIKOLAI: 看见了，可那些是什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/therme.yarn-theFireShips-3773": "DIETRICH: 卡尔拿旧军用望远镜看过，说是船。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/therme.yarn-theFireShips-3774": "NIKOLAI: 会飞的船……？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/therme.yarn-theFireShips-3775": "NIKOLAI: 我得去找我的人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/therme.yarn-theFireShips-3776": "DIETRICH: 是，你得去。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/therme.yarn-theFireShips-3777": "DIETRICH: 看来总理盼着的战争，终于要来了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/therme.yarn-theFireShips-3778": "DIETRICH: 不过……也许靠着这些飞船，这仗还真能很快打完，谁能料到我们会有这种东西呢？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/therme.yarn-theFireShips-3779": "DIETRICH: 敌人肯定也想不到。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/therme.yarn-theFireShips-3780": "NIKOLAI: 我得走了，爸，很快再来看你。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/therme.yarn-theFireShips-3781": "DIETRICH: 当心些，尼科，我知道你会的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/therme.yarn-postShipsDialogue-3782": "DIETRICH: 祝你好运，孩子。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/therme.yarn-cantLeaveTherme-3783": "NIKOLAI: 天晚了，该去面包店看看父亲。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/therme.yarn-cantLeaveTherme-3784": "NIKOLAI: 现在不能走，得先确认小队在旅馆的住宿安排。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/therme.yarn-morningScene-3785": "WEISS: 班长，看见那些船了吗？简直像从古老英雄故事里开出来的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/therme.yarn-morningScene-3786": "MUELLER: 你知道咱们还有这种东西？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/therme.yarn-morningScene-3787": "ALTMAYER: 不，士兵，连我都不知道。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/therme.yarn-morningScene-3788": "NIKOLAI: 长官？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/therme.yarn-morningScene-3789": "ALTMAYER: 普罗赫上士，带你的小队去斯特拉尔城的指挥所报到。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/therme.yarn-morningScene-3790": "ALTMAYER: 不巧，所有车辆都在运送前线作战部队越过边境。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/therme.yarn-morningScene-3791": "ALTMAYER: 你们步行过去，城市在这里的东南方。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/therme.yarn-morningScene-3792": "ALTMAYER: 出发，士兵们！我随后就到。"
}
